{"seq":2,"slug":"remix-loader-action","title":"Remix Loader/Action 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/frameworks/remix-loader-action","wordCount":1121,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"remix-loader-action-模式\">Remix Loader/Action 模式</h1><p>Remix（2026 年已演化为 React Router v7 的 Framework Mode）代表了与 Next.js 截然不同的服务端渲染哲学：<strong>Web 标准优先，渐进增强为核心</strong>。Loader 返回的是标准 <code>Response</code> 对象，Action 处理的是标准 <code>FormData</code>，路由嵌套天然支持并行数据加载——所有这些设计都紧贴 HTTP 协议和 HTML 表单的原生语义，而不是发明新的抽象层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Remix（现已演化为 React Router v7 的 Framework Mode）的哲学是 <strong>Web 标准优先、渐进增强为核心</strong>：Loader 在服务端加载数据并返回标准 <code>Response</code>，Action 处理标准 <code>FormData</code> 的变更，嵌套路由让所有匹配段的 Loader 并行执行而非瀑布式串行。Action 完成后框架自动重调当前页面所有活跃 Loader，无需手动 invalidate。与 Next.js Server Actions 相比，它把数据流锚定在请求/响应与表单语义上，而非 React 原语。</p>\n<h2 id=\"loader-服务端数据加载\">Loader：服务端数据加载</h2><p>Loader 是 Remix 路由的数据获取原语。每个路由模块可以导出一个 <code>loader</code> 函数，在服务端执行，返回该路由需要的数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// app/routes/posts.$postId.tsx&#10;import type { LoaderFunctionArgs } from &#39;react-router&#39;;&#10;import { useLoaderData } from &#39;react-router&#39;;&#10;&#10;export async function loader({ params, request }: LoaderFunctionArgs) {&#10;  const post = await db.post.findUnique({&#10;    where: { id: params.postId },&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  if (!post) {&#10;    throw new Response(&#39;Not Found&#39;, { status: 404 });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 返回标准 Response 对象&#10;  return Response.json(post, {&#10;    headers: {&#10;      &#39;Cache-Control&#39;: &#39;public, max-age=300&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&#10;export default function PostRoute() {&#10;  const post = useLoaderData&lt;typeof loader&gt;();&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;article&gt;&#10;      &lt;h1&gt;{post.title}&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;      &lt;div&gt;{post.content}&lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/article&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/routes/posts.$postId.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { LoaderFunctionArgs } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-router'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useLoaderData } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-router'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoaderFunctionArgs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> post</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.post.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findUnique</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    where: { id: params.postId },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">post) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Not Found'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { status: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">404</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 返回标准 Response 对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(post, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    headers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'Cache-Control'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'public, max-age=300'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PostRoute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> post</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useLoaderData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loader>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">article</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{post.title}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{post.content}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">article</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Loader 的关键特性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行环境</td>\n<td>仅服务端（SSR）或浏览器端（客户端导航时作为 fetch）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回类型</td>\n<td>标准 <code>Response</code> 对象或可序列化值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP 语义</td>\n<td>可设置 status、headers、Cache-Control</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n<td>throw Response → 最近的 ErrorBoundary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td><code>typeof loader</code> 推断 → <code>useLoaderData&lt;typeof loader&gt;()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"嵌套路由并行加载\">嵌套路由并行加载</h2><p>Remix 的核心性能优势来自嵌套路由的并行数据加载。当 URL 匹配多个嵌套路由段时，所有匹配路由的 Loader <strong>同时执行</strong>，而非瀑布式串行：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph URL: /dashboard/projects/42&#10;        A[&quot;root.tsx loader&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;dashboard.tsx loader&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;projects.$id.tsx loader&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 执行模型&#10;        D[请求到达] --&gt; E[匹配路由段]&#10;        E --&gt; F[Promise.all([rootLoader, dashboardLoader, projectLoader])&quot;]&#10;        F --&gt; G[所有数据就绪 → 渲染]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph URL: /dashboard/projects/42\n        A[\"root.tsx loader\"]\n        B[\"dashboard.tsx loader\"]\n        C[\"projects.$id.tsx loader\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 执行模型\n        D[请求到达] --&gt; E[匹配路由段]\n        E --&gt; F[Promise.all([rootLoader, dashboardLoader, projectLoader])\"]\n        F --&gt; G[所有数据就绪 → 渲染]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 三个嵌套路由的 Loader 并行执行&#10;// routes/root.tsx&#10;export async function loader() {&#10;  return { user: await getUser() }; // 50ms&#10;}&#10;&#10;// routes/dashboard.tsx&#10;export async function loader() {&#10;  return { stats: await getDashboardStats() }; // 100ms&#10;}&#10;&#10;// routes/dashboard.projects.$id.tsx&#10;export async function loader({ params }) {&#10;  return { project: await getProject(params.id) }; // 80ms&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 总耗时 = max(50, 100, 80) = 100ms&#10;// 而非串行的 50 + 100 + 80 = 230ms\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 三个嵌套路由的 Loader 并行执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// routes/root.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { user: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 50ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// routes/dashboard.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { stats: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getDashboardStats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 100ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// routes/dashboard.projects.$id.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { project: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getProject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.id) }; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 80ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 总耗时 = max(50, 100, 80) = 100ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 而非串行的 50 + 100 + 80 = 230ms</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"action-服务端数据变更\">Action：服务端数据变更</h2><p>Action 是 Loader 的变更对应物——处理表单提交和数据修改：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// app/routes/posts.new.tsx&#10;import type { ActionFunctionArgs } from &#39;react-router&#39;;&#10;import { redirect } from &#39;react-router&#39;;&#10;import { Form, useActionData, useNavigation } from &#39;react-router&#39;;&#10;&#10;export async function action({ request }: ActionFunctionArgs) {&#10;  const formData = await request.formData();&#10;  const title = formData.get(&#39;title&#39;) as string;&#10;  const content = formData.get(&#39;content&#39;) as string;&#10;&#10;  // 验证&#10;  const errors: Record&lt;string, string&gt; = {};&#10;  if (!title || title.length &lt; 3) {&#10;    errors.title = &#39;标题至少 3 个字符&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;  if (!content || content.length &lt; 10) {&#10;    errors.content = &#39;内容至少 10 个字符&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  if (Object.keys(errors).length &gt; 0) {&#10;    return Response.json({ errors }, { status: 400 });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const post = await db.post.create({ data: { title, content } });&#10;  return redirect(`/posts/${post.id}`);&#10;}&#10;&#10;export default function NewPost() {&#10;  const actionData = useActionData&lt;typeof action&gt;();&#10;  const navigation = useNavigation();&#10;  const isSubmitting = navigation.state === &#39;submitting&#39;;&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Form method=&quot;post&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;label&gt;&#10;        标题&#10;        &lt;input name=&quot;title&quot; required /&gt;&#10;        {actionData?.errors?.title &amp;&amp; &lt;span&gt;{actionData.errors.title}&lt;/span&gt;}&#10;      &lt;/label&gt;&#10;      &lt;label&gt;&#10;        内容&#10;        &lt;textarea name=&quot;content&quot; required /&gt;&#10;        {actionData?.errors?.content &amp;&amp; &lt;span&gt;{actionData.errors.content}&lt;/span&gt;}&#10;      &lt;/label&gt;&#10;      &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot; disabled={isSubmitting}&gt;&#10;        {isSubmitting ? &#39;发布中...&#39; : &#39;发布&#39;}&#10;      &lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/Form&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/routes/posts.new.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ActionFunctionArgs } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-router'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { redirect } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-router'</spa